      <title>Trump’s Plan for East Potomac Golf Course Smacks of Elitism</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-21/trump-s-plan-for-east-potomac-golf-course-smacks-of-elitism</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">6e841dd9dd50d49f2f5324ba</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:00:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>President Donald Trump declared East Potomac Golf Links, one of Washington, DC’s most popular public golf courses, “old, broken, dilapidated, and of no further use or effect.” That last claim will come as news to the golfers who reportedly played roughly 125,000 rounds there last year.</description>
