      <title>Jensen Huang Is Right that Fear Keeps UK Business Thinking Small</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-21/jensen-huang-is-right-that-fear-keeps-uk-business-thinking-small</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">595c3e94c0416fba6929b53a</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 04:00:10 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Nobody in Britain wants to agree with a leather-jacket-wearing American tycoon. But it’s tough to poke holes in Jensen Huang’s diagnosis of what’s gone wrong with the UK. Last week, the Nvidia Corp. boss told politicians and investors gathered in a converted London church that the country has enough intellect but not enough entrepreneurial spirit. Offered a million ways to win, he says, it tends to find “the one reason not to do it.”</description>
